 | `dist.py` | Assembles the player's folder in `build/dist/<target>` after `build.py --dist`: `setup/` with a portable CPython (python-build-standalone) with numpy, lz4 and fontTools, zig 0.17.1 (for Windows also its C runtime, prebuilt in `setup/lib/crt/` so the setup links without building it: issue #2; made by zig's Linux build, or its Windows build on a Windows host), LLVM's own clang of zig's LLVM version in `setup/clang` (Linux x86-64 and Windows, `llvm_clang.py`), `glslc` from conda-forge and the sources the setup runs (`tools/prepare/prepare.py`); the start screen creates the desktop shortcut (`.desktop` on Linux, `.lnk` on Windows). Each download checked against its sha256 | `uv run tools/build/dist.py [--target linux\|windows] [--check]` |
